at the start of the movie a little girl  and an old man venture out of their home  to get some fresh air however what they  see completely shocks them the city of  london which was sprawling with humans  in traffic just the previous night has  suddenly been covered with a thick  forest the skyscrapers monuments houses  everything has been covered with  gigantic trees that emerged from nowhere  it doesn't take them long to realize  that the final days of humanity have  arrived as nature is taking back what is  theirs in the next scene several news  channels report that the mysterious  trees have not only engulfed london but  the whole world everywhere people are  panicking over the sudden appearance of  the trees and now some countries  including the united kingdom are  planning to burn down the trees to clear  them jamaica says we've been burning  trees for centuries no need to stop now  elsewhere we are introduced to clara and  her boyfriend danny the two are teachers  at a local school and have brought some  of their special students on a museum  sleepover trip after gathering all their  belongings the group decides to head  home one student stops to stare at a  cross-section of a tree on display  noticing that it has a single thick red  ring depicting how many years it grew  clara not knowing what it means simply  guesses that it must have been a good  year to be a tree when they reach the  entrance the guard for some reason fails  to open the door realizing that it is  jammed dany urges the students to help  and finally opens the door however when  they reach outside they are completely  shocked by what they see trees have  taken over the entire city a confused  clara quickly calls the old man from  earlier who is actually doctor who an  alien tasked with rectifying the  anomalies of the universe it turns out  that clara is his accomplice and the two  are known for solving strange mysteries  around the universe she asks the doctor  if he's in the area and he says yes he  further mentions that he is not alone as  a little girl named maebe is giving him  company hearing the name clara becomes  surprised as mabe is one of her students  and she is supposed to be in their group  doctor who is being suss wasting no time  she tells dany about the situation and  the two start blaming each other for  their carelessness as they argue we get  to know that maebe is suffering from  emotional trauma and has regular  medications for it shortly after danny  clara and all the students reach the  doctor's base which is called tardis to  bring back mabe there one of the  students ruby breaks a small branch and  finds out there are no rings in it she  finds it very strange as a tree's age is  determined by its rings one ring equals  one year just then doctor who approaches  them and reveals that the tree has no  rings because it grew overnight just  like all the other ones in the world  dany asserts that it is impossible but  the doctor responds that it is similar  to the ice age which appeared out of  nowhere and decimated the earth in just  a few days he jokingly says welcome to  the tree age welcome  to the tree age oh doctor who following  this the entire group enters tardis  while the adults try to decipher the  situation the kids are busy playing with  the high-end gadgets present inside just  then the doctor comes across someone's  assignment book which has a series of  drawings each page having a picture of  an angry son striking down trees he  demands to know who drew the pictures  and learns that it was none other than  maebe herself soon everyone starts  searching for the little girl but she is  nowhere to be found then clara reveals  that maebe is different from the other  students she hears voices in her head it  all started when her sister went missing  a few months back hearing this the  doctor deduces that maebe knows  something and that she was trying to  explain it all this time the voices she  hears aren't normal voices but someone  or something is trying to contact her  hence she is the only one who can lead  them to the source of the trees when the  doctor asks what the voices say clara  explains that mabe takes medication that  can make the voices go away this angers  the doctor and he shouts that they never  listen to a child he then uses his sonic  screwdriver to get a reading on mabe's  phone following this he and clara set  out to find her while danny and the kids  stay behind in the tardis during the  search a massive statue cracks and falls  on them luckily the two evade just in  time and survive the doctor claims that  if this really is an invasion by nature  they would have won easily and humanity  would be doomed hence he's still  confused on the purpose of the invasion  a while later the two find mabe's cell  phone on the ground and assume that she  is leaving clues for them their  assumptions turn out to be true when  they find her tiffin box and purse along  the way it appears as if the little girl  is trying to lead them somewhere  elsewhere mabe runs across some men in  protective suits who are preparing to  burn down the whole forest for some  reason this scares her and she  immediately changes course and runs away  shortly after the doctor and clara also  arrive at the scene only to be ordered  to vacate the area for their own safety  soon the men ignite their flamethrowers  and start burning the trees surprisingly  not a single leaf burns implying that  the trees are not normal the doctor is  equally dumbfounded by the strange  phenomenon but he deduces that the trees  are controlling the oxygen since fires  do not ignite in the absence of oxygen  the trees are deliberately holding it  back so that they do not burn with this  information the doctor starts exploring  the reasons for the strange occurrence  when he once again checks mabe's drawing  it finally dawns on him that the trees  are not the enemies but they are  actually trying to save the earth from  an impending catastrophe now they have  to find maebe as she is in some way  connected to the trees as the two are  discussing they hear some wolves howling  nearby clara asserts that it is  impossible to have wolves in london but  the doctor assumes that they broke out  of the nearby zoo on the other hand mabe  is spotted by the wolves causing her to  run in terror hearing her screams the  doctor and clara rush to help her they  find her on the other side of a fence  and just as the wolves are about to  attack mabe she spots a gate and reaches  safety however their problems are far  from over as the wolves are easily  capable of jumping the fence with their  lives on the line the doctor instructs  clara and mabe to huddle together and  act like a monster the plan doesn't work  and the wolves jump the fence but  instead of attacking the group they  whimper and run away maebe is left  confused as to why the ferocious beasts  would run away just then a bengal tiger  slowly approaches them from the other  side of the fence this time it appears  as if the group is doomed but luckily  danny and the children arrive in the  nick of time and scare the tiger away as  the two parties reunite and exchange  pleasantries mabe continues acting  strangely it seems like she is swatting  something from her head looking at her  condition ruby pleads with her teachers  to give mabe her medications but the  doctor stops them he mentions that  something is trying to contact mabe and  if she takes the medications she will  stop hearing the voices in her head he  further mentions that the voices may be  instrumental in deciphering the  situation soon mabe runs off again and  everyone pursues her she leads them to a  barren place where there are no trees or  vegetation with everyone's attention on  her mabe reveals that after the  disappearance of her sister annabelle  she started searching for her everywhere  she couldn't find annabelle but what she  did find were several thoughts one of  the thoughts talked about covering the  entire world with dense forest claiming  that it is necessary the doctor inquires  about the source of the thoughts but  little mabe can't give a definite answer  as a result he takes out his sonic  screwdriver and operates it on mabe this  causes the object's irritating mabe to  become visible as sparks of light soon  the lights become still and use mabe to  communicate they reveal that they are  the life force of the trees which have  been on earth for billions of years and  will continue to live for eternity their  duty is to save the earth from external  threats and this time the threat is the  approaching solar flare from the sun  confused the doctor asks the life force  if they sent mabe to him but they deny  it saying this the lights leave freeing  mabe of her sickness later clara  approaches the doctor and inquires if he  can save the world unfortunately he  replies that he can only stop evil  forces not nature with all hopes now  seemingly lost clara proposes an idea to  at least save the children and  themselves by entering the tardis and  transporting to a different direction  however when the group reaches the  tardis she tells the doctor that none of  the kids will be joining them they  simply cannot abandon their parents and  run off to another planet it turns out  that she faked the idea just to get the  doctor back to safety as he is essential  in the timeline not wanting to be alone  the doctor tells clara that earth is his  planet too and asks her to join him  however she also refuses claiming that  she doesn't want to be the last of her  kind with this the sleepover group  departs leaving the doctor alone in the  tardis in the next scene as the doctor  is continuing his research he comes to a  sudden realization that the solar flare  has happened before in the past he then  rushes to meet the group and brings them  back inside the tardis there he explains  that the trees are the real heroes and  that they have been protecting life on  earth for centuries whenever a major  catastrophe hit they sprung up all over  the world to keep it safe from  devastation for instance the tunguska  blast of 1908 and the 1930 karuka impact  in brazil should have wiped humanity but  it didn't this is because the trees all  over the world reunite and neutralize  the threat by controlling the atmosphere  massive forests fill the atmosphere with  oxygen pumping it up like a highly  inflammable airbag as a result when  trouble hits the impact burns off the  excess oxygen so they act as a shield  that protects the earth clara then  points out that the tree they saw  earlier in the museum has a red ring in  its cross section and the red ring is  wider than the others which is proof  that the atmospheric dust was captured  by the tree while saving the earth a  long time ago just then danny reveals  that he heard the government is sending  out teams to defoliate the trees they  will drop extremely poisonous chemicals  onto the leaves and as a result of which  the trees will finally die hearing this  the doctor becomes enraged as humanity  is trying to kill the only element that  is trying to save the earth luckily he  finds that the mobile networks are still  operating and decides to broadcast a  message to the entire earth little mabe  offers to convey the message since she  was the first to receive the news and  the doctor agrees after this the kids  gather around and start composing a  message while the doctor hacks into  every communication device in the world  once everything is set up mabe starts  speaking her speech is heard around the  world advising everyone to be calm and  that the trees are to be left alone as  they serve a benevolent purpose she  tells everyone that the trees are their  friends and that they are here to save  the earth from a disaster so they should  just stay inside their homes and let the  trees do their work before hanging up  she also requests that her sister  annabelle return shortly after the kids  head outside determined to meet their  family since they are not sure if the  earth will be saved they want to spend  the last hours with their loved ones  hearing mabe's message her mother also  arrives outside the tardis and hugs her  tightly before leaving the doctor asks  the kids if they want to watch the solar  flare from space but they refuse only  his companion clara agrees to it but  only after all the kids are returned  home she and danny then share a kiss  which the children laugh at as the  rumors about them dating have been  proven true later the two time travelers  reach space in their tardis and watch  the earth soon the solar flare strikes  and the earth is covered in flames  however according to the doctor's  prediction the trees absorb the  devastation and eventually save earth  later as they look over london the  gigantic trees start crumbling away  clara wonders what will be told about  the trees but the doctor replies that  they will simply be forgotten just like  any story in the past it will simply  become a fairy tale as humankind has one  superpower the power of forgetting  things unless someone filmed it for tick  tock elsewhere mabe and her mom happily  return home after a great day of  adventure just then the little girl  spots someone in a nearby bush and  becomes excited the movie ends as the  bush evaporates into the air exposing  her long-lost sister annabelle subscribe  for more videos like this turn on  notifications and leave a like to help  the channel out thank you for watching

